<p>Inflicts <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">134, 180, 216, 246, 273</acronym> temporal damage, and attempts to stun all targets in a radius <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">1, 1, 2, 2, 2</acronym> ball for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">3, 3, 4, 4, 5</acronym> turns.</p><p>The damage will scale with your Spellpower.</p>